      "id": "09f12a3c-089f-42da-98be-7948378b9a0e",
      "title": "Cleanup failure hides a failed hook check",
      "description": "`tick()` emits the failure event only when it catches a `HooksCheckError`, but the local workspace setup replaces that error with a plain `Error` if teardown reports leftovers. When a settings check or self-test fails alongside workspace cleanup, the run log records the cleanup error without the hook report or its problems.",
