    {
      "id": "9fd82c03-f705-4f0c-b127-2d2255133a9f",
      "title": "Hook checks trail ticket pickup",
      "description": "`tick()` logs `picked` before constructing the workspace, then logs `hooks-checked` only after `deps.workspace(runId)` returns or throws. Every run that reaches hook validation therefore records the check after pickup, rather than before `picked` as the ticket requires; the new test asserts only that it precedes agent startup.",
